$string['check:staleactions:missing_details'] = 'An instance is configured for the actions that existed when it was created, and installing a plugin that defines a new one does not revisit that. The switch on the provider settings screen cannot turn these on either, because for an action outside core it writes a setting nothing reads. Recreating the router instance is what fixes it. Affected: {$a}.';
