$string['courseusage:budget'] = 'Budget for this course';
$string['courseusage:budget:intro'] = 'How much of the AI budget set for this course has been used. An amount of money is not shown here: it is what the site spends, and this page is about how the course is using the AI rather than about what the site pays. A budget counted in requests is shown in full, because how much the course used is this page\'s own subject. When a budget is reached, requests from this course follow whichever rule the site has put next, which may be a cheaper provider or none at all.';
