$string['eligibility:match:any'] = 'Any one condition is enough';
$string['eligibility:match_help'] = 'Both are ordinary things to mean. "Teachers, or anyone in the BYOK cohort" needs any one condition; "teachers who are also in that cohort" needs every condition. A condition left empty takes no part either way, and a policy with no conditions at all admits nobody.';
