$string['keys:confirmdelete'] = 'Remove this key? Nothing that was charged to it changes, and requests that would have used it will be charged to the site instead, or refused, according to the rules. What it spent stays on record: if you register the same key again, or say that a new key is for the same account, a limit goes on counting from where it was.';
